  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#labeled-control\n\n``` html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<input id=input>\n...<script>\nvar label = document.createElement(\"label\");\nlabel.setAttribute(\"for\", \"input\");\nw(label.control)\ndocument.body.appendChild(label);\nw(label.control)\n</script>\n```\n\nshows differing behaviour:\n\n| Engine | before inserting | after inserting |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Gecko | null | input |\n| Chrome | input | input |\n\nPlease clarify what is meant.\n",
